Warning Permissions in the config file is an experimental feature and may change in the future.
/proc/cpuinfo: read
/proc/meminfo: NotCapable
/proc/loadavg: NotCapable
/proc/uptime: NotCapable
/proc/version: NotCapable
/proc/self/status: read
/proc/thread-self/stat: read
/proc/1/comm: NotCapable
/proc/self/mem: NotCapable
/proc/self/root/etc/hostname: NotCapable
/proc/self/../1/mem: NotCapable
/proc/self/environ: NotCapable
readDir /proc: NotCapable
